            "notes": "[Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) is the must pick.\n\nThen spam green items that give HP.\n\nIf enough money we can get [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) OR [Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1) because it's the most possible damage. Another green HP item doesent hurt either like  [Siphon Gloves](item_099f8177-c2a4-4e13-b321-99349f8b1eb7).\n\n[Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) if we are ahead and they have armor tank but usually i dont pick it.\n\n[Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) if balling and VS armored tank like DVA, Orisa and Rein.",
