            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-07-30T01:17:31.065218+00:00",
            "notes": "[Bullseye](item_19cf3c95-5071-425e-beba-30af6ba15ef1) pairs well with [Just Roll With It](item_71918d53-d84e-48f1-9940-8fbe0d9d5a41).\n\n[Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) and spamming green HP items is the most damage and HP you can get for average rounds. You can replace it with [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce) or [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) if you have enough money, but I wouldnt sell green items for it.\n\nIf poor round [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) with green item spam is still good and a solid 10% increase in damage.\n\nIf enough money, we can replace [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) or [ [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) with [Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1) or [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f).",
