        {
            "id": "a5200c6e-6f67-4e49-bc48-724cb0c215c7",
            "build_id": "a3f46847-b3d7-4b8c-96a4-201e701ba5e8",
            "round_number": 4,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-07-30T01:17:31.065218+00:00",
            "notes": "Get the [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) or [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce), usuaully I take [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) because its more consistent and works with rightclick. Cass, Ashe, DVA, Orisa and Zen are on the easier side to headshot for example, so against those [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce) might be slightly better. In most rounds, sell [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) and then get [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) or [Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1).\n\nIf balling you keep [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27), especially VS armor, and just buy either [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) or [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce).\n\nUpgrade [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) or  preferably [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) with [Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1) if enough money.\n\nYou can counterpick Ashe, Ana JQ, Mei, or debuff comps in general with [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f).\n\n[Iron Eyes](item_f16d03a7-f20e-4a1d-a1f6-55863e163c03) VS heroes that can easily headshot you like Cass, Genji(he has an item that lets him crit with melee), Soldier, Kiriko or Zen.",
