            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-07-30T01:17:31.065218+00:00",
            "notes": "[Full House](item_0001a9dc-79d5-48c9-92b0-85060efd897e) for slightly more damage or  [Barrel Roll](item_c5368723-a7c9-4124-9bc1-7749917b0c8a) for slightly more surviability. I honestly dont think it matters that much because his powers are so bad.\n\nR5 is where we need to get some tanky items like [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f). If not [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) then [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) is a good choice.\n\nFor damage we keep our rare items, if you have enough money you can upgrade [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) to [El-sa'ka Supressor]. This item is amazing and I buy it more often. Alternatives are (item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100) [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) or [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121) or [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) VS lots of armor.\n\nA smaller upgrade is to replace [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) with [Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1).",
