            "created_at": "2025-07-30T01:17:31.065218+00:00",
            "notes": "[Barrel Roll](item_c5368723-a7c9-4124-9bc1-7749917b0c8a) not for the damage, but longer distance.\n\n[Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) generally becomes better late game than [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) in my opinion cause you get ult fast. If you really need to be tanky, then you can get [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) and  [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) together.\n\n[Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) if theres no armor, that would save you 3000 cash, that might open up another epic or rare item. Otherwise just get [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27).\n\nIn most games the new item should [El-sa'ka Supressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100) because theres so much healing in the current Meta with heroes like Mercy and Moira in every game. Theres some alternatives listed below as well.\n\nIf you have even more money to replace the last green item(usually green) then mix and match with any of the optional ones that you feel are good for the current game.  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) is the most cost effective one and is what usually should be picked. This would put you at around 85% WP.\n\n[Eagle Eye](item_89c2c86b-14d0-41ec-be3f-ba404f0122c0) and [Competitive Analysis](item_168f8109-d2cc-40cc-a6bb-2006a2f62939) should only be picked if you know what you are doing, both of these require gameplay adjustments.",
